  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e17b972750c34bd4b903f60c7caf8be2, type: 3}
  m_Name: CAPTAIN PERSONAL LOG
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subtitles:
  - line: "Captain Joan LaSais\u2019s personal diary, entry 12."
    seconds: 4.299
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: For 19 years, 4 months, and 23 days, I have manned this ship.
    seconds: 9.511
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: 12 successful missions, soon to be 13, pulling the SCS Pandora and her
      crew.
    seconds: 16.55
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: I do not tolerate failure, which means I do not tolerate alterations, improvisation,
      or mistakes.
    seconds: 23.913
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: I, and my procedure, have remained because my procedure works.
    seconds: 29.502
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: The machines have their role and the flesh has its.
    seconds: 32.833
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Everything on my ship is either inanimate or alive.
    seconds: 36.111
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Until now.
    seconds: 39.347
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: A stain sits in my cargo bay. Seeping through the fibers of my ship.
    seconds: 44.978
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "It doesn\u2019t fit in my procedure. It doesn\u2019t conform to my rules."
    seconds: 49.868
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "It doesn\u2019t come from blood or oil, but from the federation, which
      has now placed it under my responsibility."
    seconds: 58.269
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: I should have known that my orders would change when they decided to retrofit
      my ship without consulting me.
    seconds: 63.786
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: And now this creature which has been torn apart and stitched together,
      yet somehow survives,
    seconds: 82
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: is weighing us down.
    seconds: 89.338
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "They told me it\u2019s supposed to hold the key to perfect, eternal youth."
    seconds: 95.437
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: I only allowed it on this vessel because they said I was the only captain
      who they could trust with the secret.
    seconds: 101.939
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Maybe I\u2019m just the only captain who bought into it."
    seconds: 104.463
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: That astrobiologist they added to my crew, in case of an emergency with
      the creature;
    seconds: 112.256
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "she won\u2019t be any help if something goes wrong."
    seconds: 114.836
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: No human, on the ship or off of it, could stop that creature.
    seconds: 119.833
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: I should know. I hand-selected every other member of this crew myself.
    seconds: 125.892
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: But I will persevere. This will not be my last mission.
    seconds: 130.422
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "I\u2019ll see us through to the other side, and I\u2019ll never look back."
    seconds: 134.719
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "The rest of the crew don\u2019t know what sleeps on this ship next to
      them;"
    seconds: 137.835
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "they don\u2019t feel the ink saturating the very steel like I do."
    seconds: 143.239
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: I have walked these halls and felt the hum and heartbeat of these pistons
      for far too long to let that thing undo me.
    seconds: 151.323
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "It threatens to crash the Pandora, but I\u2019ll keep us afloat."
    seconds: 155.031
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: I will bring her, and my crew, home.
    seconds: 158.136
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  audioName: CAPTAIN PERSONAL LOG
